build, dedupe by linkedin_url, CSV+JSONL+per-contact MD emit, state.json
checkpoint); the agent feeds structured records via `record`. Subcommands:
plan / next N / record FILE / status. Outputs write to the pg-pts vault
_analysis/ dir (separate from this repo).

